    "text": "Finding: Christchurch cohort: links between childhood self-control and adult outcomes largely explained by conduct problems, SES, IQ and gender (4 of 14 remained). US and UK replication: pattern largely reproduced; education, work and finance links diminished with more covariates; others more robust.\nSources: Fergusson, Boden & Horwood (2013), JAACAP, DOI 10.1016/j.jaac.2013.04.008; Koepp, Watts, Gershoff et al. (2023), Developmental Psychology, DOI 10.1037/dev0001533.\nConfidence: HIGH. Both DOIs confirmed 2026-10-03."
