    "text": "Finding: Takeaway 'Cool it down': out of sight, something else to think about, name the rule.\nSources: Mischel & Ebbesen (1970); Mischel, Ebbesen & Zeiss (1972); Kirkham et al. (2003); Doebel & Zelazo (2015).\nConfidence: MODERATE. Lab findings applied at home; the script says 'helped in the research, and they cost nothing to try'."
