    "text": "Finding: Replications: fathers; community practitioners; Hong Kong; mainland China; Norway; online in Switzerland with small effects.\nSources: Havighurst et al. (2019), Social Development, DOI 10.1111/sode.12375 (162 fathers); Wilson et al. (2012), Journal of Family Psychology, DOI 10.1037/a0026480; Chan et al. (2021), Developmental Psychology, DOI 10.1037/dev0001258; Qiu et al. (2021), Child Psychiatry and Human Development, DOI 10.1007/s10578-020-01101-6 (89 mothers); Bolstad et al. (2025), Journal of Applied Developmental Psychology, DOI 10.1016/j.appdev.2025.101795; Burkhardt et al. (2024), Scientific Reports, DOI 10.1038/s41598-024-55689-z.\nConfidence: MODERATE. Several by the developers' group or collaborators; the Hong Kong and China trials mostly measured parent-reported outcomes."
