    "text": "Finding: Theory-of-mind training meta-analysis: g = 0.75 on trained tasks; transfer to everyday life unclear.\nSources: Hofmann et al. (2016), Training children's theory-of-mind: A meta-analysis of controlled studies, Cognition, DOI 10.1016/j.cognition.2016.01.006 (45 studies, 1,529 children). Sprung, Münch, Harris, Ebesutani & Hofmann (2015), Developmental Review, DOI 10.1016/j.dr.2015.05.001 (emotion understanding training, g .31 to .64).\nConfidence: MODERATE. Not quoted in narration; supports 'good practice, not a guaranteed boost'."
