    "text": "Finding: A review of negativism: its development, its links with autonomy, attachment and temperament, and the development of No and symbolic negation.\nSources: Wenar (1982), On negativism, Human development, DOI 10.1159/000272787.\nConfidence: MEDIUM. A theoretical review; the only age in the abstract is the first year, where it reconstructs the beginnings of negativism. Slide 10 is mostly reasoning from the studies on the surrounding slides: what a refusal requires, and why it travels with self-recognition. Please read that slide as interpretation."
