    "text": "- Reynolds & Burton (2017), serve-and-return communication foundations, *Arts Educ. Policy Rev.*\n- McMurray (2007), \"Defusing the childhood vocabulary explosion,\" *Science*.\n- Frank, Braginsky, Yurovsky & Marchman (2016), Wordbank developmental vocabulary repository, *J. Child Lang.*\n- Lin et al. (2023), dual-MEG interbrain synchronization during parent–child turn-taking, *Cerebral Cortex*.\n- Romeo et al. (2018), \"Beyond the 30-million-word gap: children's conversational exposure is associated with language-related brain function,\" *Psychological Science*.\n- Fernandez-Duque, Hayakawa & Marian (2023), language and visual memory, *Science Advances*."
